    source motion is separate from approximate procedural cosmetics.
  Mark-only network/adapters verified in fresh-process probes. Corrected
    four-view/all-emotion GIF and retained failed first capture document fit.
  GitHub: https://github.com/Zanark/Verona/issues/65

